                      <span style={{ background: 'rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.2)', color: '#fca5a5', fontSize: 11, padding: '2px 8px', borderRadius: 99, border: '1px solid rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.4)' }}>
                        🔒 Private (Auto SEO Blocked)
                      </span>
